"Database restored from checkpoint #%1$d. Pre-restore safety checkpoint: "
"#%2$d."
msgstr "Database dipulihkan dari checkpoint #%1$d. Checkpoint pengaman pra-pemulihan: #%2$d."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:282
msgid "Checkpoint deleted."
msgstr "Checkpoint dihapus."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:338
msgid ""
"Connect AI agents like <strong>Claude</strong>, <strong>ChatGPT</strong>, or "
"<strong>Codex</strong> to this WordPress site over the Model Context "
"Protocol."
msgstr "Hubungkan agen AI seperti <strong>Claude</strong>, <strong>ChatGPT</strong>, atau <strong>Codex</strong> ke situs WordPress ini melalui Model Context Protocol."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:344
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Koneksi"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:345
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:346
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "Aktivitas"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:347
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "Log"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:348
msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

#. translators: %s: Model Context Protocol website URL.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:375
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Cowboy MCP</strong> turns this WordPress site into a <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model Context Protocol</a> "
"server, so AI coding agents like Claude Code, Codex, and Opencode can read, "
"edit, and manage the whole site through a single authenticated endpoint."
msgstr "<strong>Cowboy MCP</strong> mengubah situs WordPress ini menjadi server <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model Context Protocol</a>, sehingga agen pengkodean AI seperti Claude Code, Codex, dan Opencode dapat membaca, mengedit, dan mengelola seluruh situs melalui satu endpoint terautentikasi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:389
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Situs Web"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:390
msgid "Project home, guides, and news."
msgstr "Beranda proyek, panduan, dan berita."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:396
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:397
msgid "Source, issues & releases."
msgstr "Kode sumber, isu & rilis."

#. translators: %s: plugin version number
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:405
#, php-format
msgid "v%s · GPL-2.0"
msgstr "v%s · GPL-2.0"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:426
msgid "Which app do you want to connect?"
msgstr "Aplikasi mana yang ingin Anda hubungkan?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:427
msgid ""
"Pick your AI app or coding tool from the list to see step-by-step setup "
"instructions."
msgstr "Pilih aplikasi AI atau alat pengkodean Anda dari daftar untuk melihat petunjuk penyiapan langkah demi langkah."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:458
msgid "No terminal needed"
msgstr "Tidak perlu terminal"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:459
msgid "Terminal & IDE tools"
msgstr "Alat Terminal & IDE"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:463
msgid "AI clients"
msgstr "Klien AI"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:508
msgid ""
"<strong>Heads up:</strong> this site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS "
"address. ChatGPT connects from OpenAI's cloud, so it cannot reach local, "
"private, or non-HTTPS sites. A terminal tool works here instead, or connect "
"through a tunnel/staging URL."
msgstr "<strong>Perhatian:</strong> situs ini tampaknya tidak berada di alamat HTTPS publik. ChatGPT terhubung dari cloud OpenAI, sehingga tidak dapat menjangkau situs lokal, privat, atau non-HTTPS. Alat terminal dapat digunakan di sini sebagai gantinya, atau hubungkan melalui URL tunnel/staging."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:509
msgid ""
"<strong>Heads up:</strong> this site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS "
"address. The Claude apps connect from Anthropic's cloud, so they cannot "
"reach local, private, or non-HTTPS sites. A terminal tool works here "
"instead, or connect through a tunnel/staging URL."
msgstr "<strong>Perhatian:</strong> situs ini tampaknya tidak berada di alamat HTTPS publik. Aplikasi Claude terhubung dari cloud Anthropic, sehingga tidak dapat menjangkau situs lokal, privat, atau non-HTTPS. Alat terminal dapat digunakan di sini sebagai gantinya, atau hubungkan melalui URL tunnel/staging."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:511
msgid ""
"This opens a secure sign-in so ChatGPT can connect without a terminal. No "
"access is granted until you approve it in your browser."
msgstr "Ini membuka proses masuk yang aman sehingga ChatGPT dapat terhubung tanpa terminal. Tidak ada akses yang diberikan sampai Anda menyetujuinya di browser Anda."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:512
msgid ""
"This opens a secure sign-in so the Claude apps can connect without a "
"terminal. No access is granted until you approve it in your browser."
msgstr "Ini membuka proses masuk yang aman sehingga aplikasi Claude dapat terhubung tanpa terminal. Tidak ada akses yang diberikan sampai Anda menyetujuinya di browser Anda."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:514
msgid "You'll paste this into ChatGPT in the next step."
msgstr "Anda akan menempelkan ini ke ChatGPT pada langkah berikutnya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:515
msgid "You'll paste this into Claude in the next step."
msgstr "Anda akan menempelkan ini ke Claude pada langkah berikutnya."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:517
msgid "Add it in ChatGPT"
msgstr "Tambahkan di ChatGPT"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:518
msgid "Add it in the Claude app"
msgstr "Tambahkan di aplikasi Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:519
msgid "Add it on claude.ai"
msgstr "Tambahkan di claude.ai"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:522
msgid ""
"ChatGPT opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Review what it "
"is asking for and click <strong>Approve</strong>. That is it — you are "
"connected."
msgstr "ChatGPT membuka halaman masuk di <strong>situs Anda</strong>. Tinjau apa yang dimintanya dan klik <strong>Setujui</strong>. Selesai — Anda sudah terhubung."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:523
msgid ""
"Claude opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Review what it is "
"asking for and click <strong>Approve</strong>. That is it — you are connected."
msgstr "Claude membuka halaman masuk di <strong>situs Anda</strong>. Tinjau apa yang dimintanya dan klik <strong>Setujui</strong>. Selesai — Anda sudah terhubung."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:525
msgid ""
"Custom connectors require a paid ChatGPT plan with <strong>Developer mode</"
"strong> (beta) enabled."
msgstr "Konektor khusus memerlukan paket ChatGPT berbayar dengan <strong>Developer mode</strong> (beta) yang diaktifkan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:526
msgid ""
"Custom connectors require a Claude <strong>Pro, Max, Team, or Enterprise</"
"strong> plan."
msgstr "Konektor khusus memerlukan paket Claude <strong>Pro, Max, Team, atau Enterprise</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:542
msgid "Turn on the Desktop Connector"
msgstr "Nyalakan Desktop Connector"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:548
msgid "Enable Desktop Connector"
msgstr "Aktifkan Desktop Connector"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:559
msgid "Copy your connection link"
msgstr "Salin tautan koneksi Anda"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:566
msgid "Copy connector URL"
msgstr "Salin URL konektor"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:566 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:641
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:722
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Salin"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:578
msgid ""
"Go to <code>chatgpt.com</code> (or open the ChatGPT desktop app) and sign in."
msgstr "Buka <code>chatgpt.com</code> (atau buka aplikasi desktop ChatGPT) dan masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:579
msgid ""
"Go to <code>Settings → Connectors → Advanced</code> and turn on "
"<strong>Developer mode</strong> (one-time)."
msgstr "Buka <code>Settings → Connectors → Advanced</code> dan nyalakan <strong>Developer mode</strong> (sekali saja)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:580
msgid "Back in <code>Connectors</code>, click <strong>Create</strong>."
msgstr "Kembali di <code>Connectors</code>, klik <strong>Create</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:581
msgid ""
"Paste the link from step 1 as the <strong>MCP server URL</strong>, set "
"Authentication to <strong>OAuth</strong>, and click <strong>Create</strong>."
msgstr "Tempelkan tautan dari langkah 1 sebagai <strong>MCP server URL</strong>, atur Authentication ke <strong>OAuth</strong>, lalu klik <strong>Create</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:584
msgid "Open the <strong>Claude</strong> desktop app and sign in."
msgstr "Buka aplikasi desktop <strong>Claude</strong> dan masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:586
msgid "Go to <code>claude.ai</code> in your browser and sign in."
msgstr "Buka <code>claude.ai</code> di browser Anda dan masuk."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:588
msgid "Go to <code>Customize → Connections</code>."
msgstr "Buka <code>Customize → Connections</code>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:589
msgid "Click <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."
msgstr "Klik <strong>Add custom connector</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:590
msgid "Paste the link from step 1 and click <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr "Tempelkan tautan dari langkah 1 lalu klik <strong>Add</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:599
msgid "Approve access"
msgstr "Setujui akses"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:633
msgid "Create an API key"
msgstr "Buat kunci API"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:637
msgid ""
"<strong>Copy your key now</strong> — for security it will not be shown again."
msgstr "<strong>Salin kunci Anda sekarang</strong> — demi keamanan, kunci tidak akan ditampilkan lagi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:641
msgid "Copy API key"
msgstr "Salin kunci API"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:642
msgid "I've saved my key"
msgstr "Saya sudah menyimpan kunci saya"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:644
msgid "Give it a name so you can recognize it later, then generate."
msgstr "Beri nama agar Anda dapat mengenalinya nanti, lalu buat."

#. translators: %s: client name, e.g. "Claude Code"
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:649
#, php-format
msgid "e.g. %s on my laptop"
msgstr "mis. %s di laptop saya"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:651
msgid "Generate another key"
msgstr "Buat kunci lain"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:651
msgid "Generate API key"
msgstr "Buat kunci API"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:667
msgid "Add the server to your tool"
msgstr "Tambahkan server ke alat Anda"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:672 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:716
msgid "Run this in your terminal:"
msgstr "Jalankan ini di terminal Anda:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:678
msgid "Run these in your terminal:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut di terminal Anda:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:685
msgid "Add this to your <code>opencode.json</code>:"
msgstr "Tambahkan ini ke <code>opencode.json</code> Anda:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:701
msgid ""
"Add this to <code>~/.cursor/mcp.json</code> (create the file if it does not "
"exist), then reload Cursor:"
msgstr "Tambahkan ini ke <code>~/.cursor/mcp.json</code> (buat file tersebut jika belum ada), lalu muat ulang Cursor:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:722
msgid "Copy setup command"
msgstr "Salin perintah penyiapan"

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:733
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open a new Claude Code session and run <code>/mcp</code> — <code>%s</code> "
"should be listed as connected."
msgstr "Buka sesi Claude Code baru dan jalankan <code>/mcp</code> — <code>%s</code> akan tercantum sebagai terhubung."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:735
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Run <code>codex mcp list</code> — <code>%s</code> should appear in the list."
msgstr "Jalankan <code>codex mcp list</code> — <code>%s</code> akan muncul dalam daftar."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:737
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Restart Opencode and ask it to list its MCP servers — <code>%s</code> should "
"be available."
msgstr "Mulai ulang Opencode dan minta untuk menampilkan daftar server MCP-nya — <code>%s</code> akan tersedia."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:739
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open <code>Cursor Settings → MCP</code> — <code>%s</code> should appear with "
"a green status dot."
msgstr "Buka <code>Cursor Settings → MCP</code> — <code>%s</code> akan muncul dengan titik status hijau."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:741
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Run <code>gemini mcp list</code> — <code>%s</code> should show as connected."
msgstr "Jalankan <code>gemini mcp list</code> — <code>%s</code> akan tampil sebagai terhubung."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:748
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa apakah berhasil"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:761
msgid "Existing keys"
msgstr "Kunci yang ada"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:766 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1170
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Label"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:767
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "Prefiks"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:768 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1169
msgid "Created"
msgstr "Dibuat"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:769 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:818
msgid "Last Used"
msgstr "Terakhir Digunakan"

#. translators: %s: human-readable time difference, e.g. "2 hours"
#. translators: %s: human-readable time difference
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:782 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:831
#, php-format
msgid "%s ago"
msgstr "%s lalu"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:784 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:833
msgid "never"
msgstr "tidak pernah"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:792
msgid "Revoke this key? Any client using it will lose access."
msgstr "Cabut kunci ini? Klien mana pun yang menggunakannya akan kehilangan akses."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:792 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:841
msgid "Revoke"
msgstr "Cabut"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:810
msgid "Connected apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi terhubung"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:815
msgid "App"
msgstr "Aplikasi"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:816
msgid "Authorized by"
msgstr "Diotorisasi oleh"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:817
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Terhubung"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:841
msgid "Revoke this connection? The app will lose access immediately."
msgstr "Cabut koneksi ini? Aplikasi akan segera kehilangan akses."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:860
msgid "General"
msgstr "Umum"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:864
msgid "MCP Server"
msgstr "Server MCP"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:868
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Diaktifkan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:870
msgid "When off, every MCP request is rejected."
msgstr "Saat nonaktif, setiap permintaan MCP ditolak."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:874
msgid "Safe Mode"
msgstr "Mode Aman"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:878
msgid "Require confirmation for destructive operations"
msgstr "Memerlukan konfirmasi untuk operasi yang merusak"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:882
msgid ""
"Tools marked as destructive (delete, drop, WP-CLI write commands, etc.) "
"require <code>confirm: true</code> in the request."
msgstr "Alat yang ditandai sebagai merusak (hapus, drop, perintah tulis WP-CLI, dll.) memerlukan <code>confirm: true</code> dalam permintaan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:889
msgid "Desktop Connector"
msgstr "Desktop Connector"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:893
msgid "Allow connecting via Claude Desktop / web (OAuth)"
msgstr "Izinkan koneksi melalui Claude Desktop / web (OAuth)"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:897
msgid ""
"Turns on the one-click browser sign-in used by the &#8220;Claude "
"Desktop&#8221; connection path. This exposes public OAuth discovery, "
"registration, and token endpoints — no tokens are issued until an "
"administrator approves in the browser. Leave off if you only connect via the "
"terminal."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan proses masuk browser sekali klik yang digunakan oleh jalur koneksi &#8220;Claude Desktop&#8221;. Ini mengekspos endpoint publik OAuth untuk discovery, registrasi, dan token — tidak ada token yang diterbitkan sampai seorang administrator menyetujui di browser. Biarkan nonaktif jika Anda hanya terhubung melalui terminal."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:904
msgid "Rate Limit"
msgstr "Batas Laju"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:907
msgid "requests per minute, per key"
msgstr "permintaan per menit, per kunci"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:911
msgid "Request Logging"
msgstr "Pencatatan Permintaan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:915
msgid "Log all tool calls to <code>debug.log</code>"
msgstr "Catat semua panggilan alat ke <code>debug.log</code>"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:924
msgid "Undo & Checkpoints"
msgstr "Pembatalan & Checkpoint"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:928
msgid "Undo Journal"
msgstr "Jurnal Pembatalan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:932
msgid "Undo journal — capture before-state of every mutating tool call"
msgstr "Jurnal pembatalan — tangkap kondisi-sebelum dari setiap panggilan alat yang mengubah data"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:934
msgid ""
"Lets changes made through MCP be undone from the Activity tab. Disabling "
"stops new entries from being captured; existing history is kept until it "
"expires."
msgstr "Memungkinkan perubahan yang dibuat melalui MCP dibatalkan dari tab Aktivitas. Menonaktifkan akan menghentikan penangkapan entri baru; riwayat yang ada disimpan hingga kedaluwarsa."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:938
msgid "Undo Retention"
msgstr "Retensi Pembatalan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:941
msgid "days to keep undo history"
msgstr "hari untuk menyimpan riwayat pembatalan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:945
msgid "Checkpoint Limit"
msgstr "Batas Checkpoint"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:948
msgid "checkpoints to keep"
msgstr "checkpoint yang disimpan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:952
msgid "Auto-Checkpoint"
msgstr "Checkpoint Otomatis"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:956
msgid "Auto-checkpoint before mutating WP-CLI commands"
msgstr "Checkpoint otomatis sebelum perintah WP-CLI yang mengubah data"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:958
msgid ""
"Takes a full-database checkpoint before running a WP-CLI command that is not "
"read-only, so it can be rolled back even if the command itself cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr "Mengambil checkpoint seluruh database sebelum menjalankan perintah WP-CLI yang tidak hanya-baca, sehingga dapat dikembalikan meskipun perintah itu sendiri tidak dapat dibatalkan."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:966 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:970
msgid "Power Mode"
msgstr "Power Mode"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:966
msgid "advanced · off by default"
msgstr "lanjutan · nonaktif secara bawaan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:974
msgid "Lift safety restrictions for advanced operations"
msgstr "Cabut pembatasan keamanan untuk operasi lanjutan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:978
msgid ""
"<strong>Danger:</strong> allows <code>eval</code>/<code>shell</code>, "
"dangerous SQL, writing files anywhere, and requests to internal addresses. "
"This grants effective <strong>remote code execution</strong> to anyone "
"holding an API key. Only enable on a trusted, locked-down site you control. "
"Your MCP API keys and the plugin&#8217;s own settings stay protected."
msgstr "<strong>Bahaya:</strong> mengizinkan <code>eval</code>/<code>shell</code>, SQL berbahaya, penulisan file di mana saja, dan permintaan ke alamat internal. Ini memberikan <strong>eksekusi kode jarak jauh</strong> yang efektif kepada siapa pun yang memegang kunci API. Aktifkan hanya di situs tepercaya dan terkunci yang Anda kendalikan. Kunci API MCP Anda dan pengaturan plugin ini sendiri tetap terlindungi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:989
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Simpan Pengaturan"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:999
msgid ""
"Audit log is not available. Please deactivate and reactivate the plugin."
msgstr "Log audit tidak tersedia. Silakan nonaktifkan lalu aktifkan kembali plugin."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1023
msgid ""
"Structured log of all MCP tool calls, errors, and auth events. Auto-pruned "
"after 30 days."
msgstr "Log terstruktur dari semua panggilan alat MCP, kesalahan, dan peristiwa autentikasi. Dibersihkan otomatis setelah 30 hari."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1030 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1085
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Peristiwa"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1032
msgid "All events"
